{
  "$comment": "Delivery manifest of the identity verification models (E22/F01/US01/T01, ADR-013-R8 and R14). No model file is committed and no hash is pinned: sha256 stays null until the operator, with the permission of the product owner (decision O7), runs scripts/biometrics/fetch-models.mjs --write-manifest. A model is used by the API only when its SHA-256 equals the Railway variable named in config.sha256. Read by scripts/biometrics/fetch-models.mjs and by ModelManifestTests; docs/runbooks/biometric-models.md has the steps.",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "toleranceRatio": 0.2,
